cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Oral Microbiome Models of Diabetes Status: A Retrospective Audit of Cross-Study Transfer"
abstract: >-
  Working manuscript: oral-only source eligibility, related-study exclusions,
  source-only nested selection, disjoint-row calibration, conditional permutation,
  and out-of-fold subgroup estimates. External benchmarks are exploratory and
  repeatedly inspected. NHANES labels are self-reported diabetes, not verified
  T2D subtype. The working manuscript is publicly hosted; no peer review is claimed.
type: software
license: MIT
